{
  $schema: 'https://docs.renovatebot.com/renovate-schema.json',
  customManagers: [
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'dev-env v2 agent image in dev-env-templates (thaynes43/dev-env DESIGN-001 D-44, D-53).',
        'templates.yaml is a ConfigMap source file, not a manifest (no apiVersion or kind), so the kubernetes manager skips it.',
        'The pin is name:tag@sha256, so Renovate bumps the tag and the digest together. The v1 hold in holds.json5 does not apply here (its matchFileNames are the v1 pins), and the dev-env manual-merge rule in autoMerge.json5 does.',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)kubernetes/main/apps/dev-env-system/templates/app/templates\\.yaml$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'image: (?<depName>ghcr\\.io/thaynes43/dev-env):(?<currentValue>[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)@(?<currentDigest>sha256:[a-f0-9]{64})',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: 'docker',
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'GitHub raw URL with path (e.g. CRD) - preserve path after version',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        '(?<prefix>\\s*# renovate: datasource=(?<datasource>\\S+) depName=(?<depName>\\S+)( repository=(?<registryUrl>\\S+))?(?:\\r\\n|\\n)\\s*-\\s+.+?/)(?<currentValue>v?[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+)(?<suffix>/[^\\s]+)',
      ],
      autoReplaceStringTemplate: '{{{prefix}}}{{{newValue}}}{{{suffix}}}',
      datasourceTemplate: '{{#if datasource}}{{{datasource}}}{{else}}github-releases{{/if}}',
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'Dockerfile ARG version pins (scripts/**/Dockerfile)',
        'The built-in `dockerfile` manager only reads FROM/image refs, so an',
        '`ARG FOO_VERSION=1.2.3` preceded by a `# renovate: datasource=… depName=…`',
        'comment needs THIS regex manager to be seen at all. Without it the',
        'annotations are pure decoration: scripts/dev-env/Dockerfile carried 21 of',
        'them and Renovate detected exactly two deps in the file (the two FROM',
        'lines) — so every baked CLI silently froze at whatever a human last typed.',
        'That is how the agent workhorse sat on claude-code 2.1.217 from 2026-07-22',
        'to 2026-08-29 (35 releases behind), which mattered because claude resolves',
        'the `opus` model ALIAS client-side: the pinned CLI served Opus 4.8 for',
        'every `--model opus` session long after Opus 5 shipped. See the dev-env',
        'image group in groups.json5 for how these land.',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)Dockerfile[^/]*$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        // NOT anchored to '# renovate:' at line start — one pin trails its comment
        // mid-line ('… (ghcr.io/siderolabs/omni). renovate: …'). Intervening FULL
        // comment lines between the annotation and the ARG are allowed too (pnpm
        // carries two). Verified 25/25 annotated pins matched across scripts/*/Dockerfile.
        'renovate: datasource=(?<datasource>\\S+) depName=(?<depName>\\S+)(?: versioning=(?<versioning>\\S+))?(?: extractVersion=(?<extractVersion>\\S+))?[^\\n]*\\n(?:#[^\\n]*\\n)*ARG \\w+_VERSION=(?<currentValue>\\S+)',
      ],
    },
    {
      customType: 'regex',
      description: [
        'Process custom dependencies',
      ],
      managerFilePatterns: [
        '/(^|/)kubernetes/.+\\.ya?ml(?:\\.j2)?$/',
      ],
      matchStrings: [
        'datasource=(?<datasource>\\S+) depName=(?<depName>\\S+)( repository=(?<registryUrl>\\S+))?\\n.+[/:](?<currentValue>v?[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+\\.[0-9]+[^\\s/]*)',
        'datasource=(?<datasource>\\S+) depName=(?<depName>\\S+)( repository=(?<registryUrl>\\S+))?\\n.+: (&\\S+\\s)?(?<currentValue>\\S+)',
      ],
      datasourceTemplate: '{{#if datasource}}{{{datasource}}}{{else}}github-releases{{/if}}',
    },
  ],
}
